  "body": "All agents' buyers are welcomed. Contact Wayne for conjunction.\r\n\r\nCommanding magnificent water views with Rangitoto and the Sky Tower captured together in the same breathtaking outlook, this exceptional Bucklands Beach residence offers a rare combination of space, sophistication and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern family living, this substantial five-bedroom home features five ensuites, ensuring privacy and convenience for every member of the household. Three separate living areas provide exceptional flexibility - whether you need space for entertaining, relaxing or simply giving the family room to spread out.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stylish open-plan kitchen with a scullery, complete with a gas cooktop and generous preparation and storage space. Central heating throughout keeps the entire home comfortable year-round, while smart-home features including Lover Tech screens and rain sensors** add another level of convenience.\r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced section provides a secure and private environment, complemented by a double internal-access garage plus additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the location. Enjoy the privilege of being within walking distance of Half Moon Bay Marina and Bucklands Beach, with the best of Auckland's coastal lifestyle right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the highly sought-after school zoning for Pigeon Mountain Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a beautiful home - it is a lifestyle defined by space, views, convenience and some of Auckland's most desirable school zones.\r\n\r\nFive bedrooms. Five ensuites. Three living areas. Magnificent water views. An exceptional Bucklands Beach address.\r\n\r\nA home of this calibre deserves to be experienced in person.",
